flowchart TD
  In[Authenticated Bilibili DM] --> Account[Account and UID scoped]
  Account --> Dm[Background DM raw short context]
  Account --> Owner[Owner Agent only when authenticated owner]
  Dm --> TTL[14d history / 7d older excerpts]
  TTL --> Model[Current same UID reply context]
  Dm --> Security[Seen / opt-out / approval / receipt untouched]
  Owner --> OwnerTTL[14d context / 24h confirmed follow-ups]
  TTL --> Admin[Local-only counts and explicit prune]
  OwnerTTL --> Admin
  Model --> Gate[Existing send authorization and real receipts]
  Security --> Gate
  Account -.-> Main[Main session memory - unchanged]
  Account -.-> Portrait[Friend portrait and fading Life Memory - unchanged]
